OL,3,GNEWSAEx-rugby player says sex assault
OL,4,A'never happened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former England rugby league player
OL,7,Fand TV pundit accused of putting her
OL,8,Fhand up a woman's skirt in a cricket
OL,9,Fclub toilet has told a jury it
OL,10,F"categorically did not happen".
OL,12,FDanika Priim, 42, has been charged with
OL,13,Fcarrying out the alleged sexual assault
OL,14,Fin the toilets at Horsforth Cricket
OL,15,FClub in Leeds on 22 July 2022.
OL,17,FHer accuser, who cannot be named for
OL,18,Flegal reasons, previously told a trial
OL,19,Fat Leeds Crown Court how Priim twice
OL,20,Freached up her dress and grabbed her
OL,21,Funderwear.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
